SUMMARY:G-STAR 2026 Premiere
DESCRIPTION:The G-STAR Organizing Committee will host G-STAR 2026 Premiere on November 18. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and CHZZK. \nThe broadcast will feature the latest updates and previously unreleased footage from major G-STAR 2026 participants representing Korea and the world\, including CD Projekt RED\, Capcom\, Everstone Studio\, Joker Studio\, Koei Tecmo Games\, KRAFTON\, miHoYo\, Starry Studio\, Team 42\, and Webzen. It will also outline the overall structure of G-STAR 2026\, which will run from November 19 to 22 at BEXCO in Busan\, South Korea\, key points of interest for visitors\, and special stage programs.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/g-star-2026-premiere
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Event_G-Star-Showcase-Inits_11-18-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
