SUMMARY:PC Gaming Show 2026: Most Wanted
DESCRIPTION:PC Gamer will host PC Gaming Show 2026: Most Wanted on December 3 at 12:00 a.m. PT / 3:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube\, Twitch\, Twitter\, and more. \nThe broadcast will be hosted by Frankie Ward (esports and gaming presenter)\, with a pre-show hosted by Future channel presenters Midas and Jules Gill. In addition to a ranked countdown of the 20 most exciting upcoming PC games\, the show will feature new trailers\, announcements\, and behind the scenes looks at over 70 games\, including: \nThief: The Dark Project Remastered (Nightdive Studios) – New trailerStage Fright (Ghost Town Games) – Behind the scenes lookStreet Witch (Alien Cartel) – New trailerAnnouncements from developers such as Devolver Digital\, Dotemu\, and Team17
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/pc-gaming-show-2026-most-wanted
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Event_PC-Gaming-Show_12-03-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
