SUMMARY:Wholesome Snack 2026
DESCRIPTION:Wholesome Games will host Wholesome Snack 2026 on December 5 at 9:00 a.m. PT / 12:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe broadcast will feature more than 25 “hopeful and uplifting games\,” including news\, world premieres\, demo announcements\, and other surprises. \nConfirmed titles include: \nBad Magpie (via)The Birdwatcher’s Journal (via)Fae & Fauna (via)Haunted Cleaner (via)Kitaria Fables 2 (via)Moomintroll: Winter’s Warmth (via)Tiny Bookshop (via)
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/wholesome-snack-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Event_Wholesome-Snack_12-05-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
