SUMMARY:The Game Awards 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Game Awards 2026 will be held on December 10 at 4:30 p.m. PT / 7:30 p.m. ET at Peacock Theater in Los Angeles\, California. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe 2026 broadcast also marks the first time the show will be streamed live on Disney+. According to a press release\, “viewers can expect major announcements and surprises from some of Disney’s most anticipated titles in gaming.” \nMore details to come.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/the-game-awards-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_TGA_12-10-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
