SUMMARY:TYPE-MOON Project New Year's Eve TV Special 2026
DESCRIPTION:Aniplex will air the TYPE-MOON Project end-of-year special program “Fate Project New Year’s Eve TV Special 2026” on December 31 at 22:00 JST across Tokyo MX\, BS11\, Gunma TV\, and Tochigi TV\, as well as Niconico and Abema. \nDetails to be announced.
